'''Sakura Miku''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sakura Miku
|image = E 501.png
|appearance = [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 4,000¢ - 15,800¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has a massive LD effective range and deals fairly high damage with a 100% chance to freeze all units for 3 seconds, with immunity to freeze/slow/knockback/weaken. Fortunately, her blindspot is rather large.

